#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLAA = clean edges at the game's render size. DLSS = the same, and it upscales when the game's "
"Scaling is below 100 %. Mix = the game's own TAA blended with DLAA / DLSS: calmer, a bit softer. "
"off = the game's own picture. Saved at once."
msgstr ""
"DLAA = tīras malas spēles renderēšanas izmērā. DLSS = tas pats, un palielina attēlu, ja spēles "
"Mērogošana ir zem 100 %. Maisījums = pašas spēles TAA, sajaukts ar DLAA / DLSS: mierīgāk, nedaudz "
"maigāk. izsl. = pašas spēles attēls. Saglabājas uzreiz."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How much of the Mix is the game's TAA, 0 - 100 % in 10 % steps: more = calmer and softer, less = "
"sharper. Shown while Mode is Mix, or a split has a Mix side. No extra cost."
msgstr ""
"Cik no maisījuma ir spēles TAA, 0 - 100 % ar soli 10 %: vairāk = mierīgāk un maigāk, mazāk = "
"asāk. Redzams, kamēr Režīms ir Maisījums vai dalījuma vienā pusē ir maisījums. Papildu izmaksu "
"nav."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Presets for your graphics card. high = everything on (model 1). medium = model 2, a lighter Glass "
"and fence fix, mirrors without Track moving parts. low = also no Smooth mirrors, no Glass and "
"fence fix, VR area 60 %. Never changes a setting you set yourself."
msgstr ""
"Sagatavotie iestatījumi jūsu videokartei. high = viss ieslēgts (modelis 1). medium = modelis 2, "
"vieglāks stiklu un žogu labojums, spoguļi bez kustīgo daļu izsekošanas. low = arī bez gludajiem "
"spoguļiem, bez stiklu un žogu labojuma, VR zona 60 %. Nekad nemaina iestatījumu, ko esat "
"iestatījis pats."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"1 (K) = most detail, sharpest text, about 1.6x the GPU of 2. 2 (E) = balanced, fewest trails "
"behind traffic: start here. 3 (F) = calmest on fences and wires, can smear moving detail, same "
"cost as 2. 4 (M) = heaviest (about 5x), flat tests only."
msgstr ""
"1 (K) = visvairāk detaļu, visasākais teksts, apmēram 1,6 reizes vairāk GPU nekā 2. 2 (E) = "
"līdzsvars, vismazāk pēdu aiz satiksmes: sāciet ar to. 3 (F) = mierīgākais uz žogiem un vadiem, "
"var izsmērēt kustīgas detaļas, tāda pati cena kā 2. 4 (M) = smagākais (apmēram 5x), tikai testiem "
"plakanajā režīmā."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Picture quality: sharpening, texture sharpness, the Glass and fence fix, the Light trail fix and "
"the DLAA area. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Attēla kvalitāte: asināšana, tekstūru asums, stiklu un žogu labojums, gaismas pēdu labojums un "
"DLAA zona. Pa labi atver grupu, pa kreisi aizver; katru reizi, kad izvēlne tiek atvērta, tā ir "
"aizvērta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharpens the picture after DLAA, 0 (off) to 1.0. Raise it if the picture looks soft; too high "
"gives bright halos on edges. Costs about 0.1 ms; 0 skips the pass."
msgstr ""
"Asina attēlu pēc DLAA, no 0 (izslēgts) līdz 1.0. Palieliniet, ja attēls mīksts; pārāk liela "
"vērtība dod gaišus oreolus malās. Maksā apmēram 0,1 ms; 0 izlaiž soli."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How far the sharpening reaches, 1 to 4 px: small = fine detail, large = bolder edges. Change it "
"if the sharpening looks too fine or too coarse; a picture drawn larger than the screen, as in VR, "
"needs more than 1 px."
msgstr ""
"Cik tālu sniedzas asināšana, no 1 līdz 4 px: mazs = smalkas detaļas, liels = rupjākas malas. "
"Mainiet, ja asināšana par smalku vai rupju; attēlam, kas zīmēts lielāks par ekrānu, kā VR, vajag "
"vairāk nekā 1 px."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharper texture text (road signs, dashboard, GPS). 0 = off; more negative = sharper but more "
"shimmer on fences; try -0.5 to -1 if text is blurry. Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Asāks teksts uz tekstūrām (ceļa zīmes, instrumentu panelis, GPS). 0 = izslēgts; jo negatīvāk, jo "
"asāk, bet vairāk mirgo žogi; ja teksts ir izplūdis, mēģiniet no -0,5 līdz -1. Gandrīz bez "
"izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The same for wire fences, grass and leaves: raise it toward 0 if fences shimmer, lower it if "
"grass looks soft. same = follows the row above. Works only while Texture sharpness is not 0. "
"Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Tas pats režģa žogiem, zālei un lapām: paceliet tuvāk 0, ja žogi mirgo, pazeminiet, ja zāle "
"izskatās mīksta. tāpat = kā rindā virs. Darbojas tikai, kamēr Tekstūru asums nav 0. Gandrīz bez "
"izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Wires, fences and windows are treated as the thing in front, not as what you see through them, so "
"they do not smear when you move. Turn it off if you see no smearing there: saves 0.02 - 0.06 ms "
"per eye."
msgstr ""
"Vadi, žogi un logi tiek uzskatīti par priekšplāna objektu, nevis par to, kas redzams caur tiem, "
"tāpēc kustībā tie neizsmērējas. Izslēdziet, ja tur izsmērēšanās nav: ietaupa 0,02 - 0,06 ms uz "
"aci."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Stops street-lamp and car-light glows leaving a trail behind them when you move: the glows are "
"drawn fresh each frame instead of being blended with older frames. 25 % steps; lower it if lamp "
"glows flicker, 0 = off. Costs about 0.05 - 0.2 ms per eye."
msgstr ""
"Neļauj ielu lukturu un auto gaismu mirdzumam atstāt pēdas kustībā: mirdzums tiek zīmēts no jauna "
"katrā kadrā, nevis sajaukts ar vecākiem kadriem. Solis 25 %; samaziniet, ja lukturu mirdzums "
"mirgo, 0 = izslēgts. Maksā apmēram 0,05 - 0,2 ms uz aci."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR: only the middle of each eye gets DLAA (20 to 100 %); the edge keeps the game's picture. Lower "
"it to afford a heavier model or win frame rate; 40 % costs about 40 % of the model. Also sets the "
"garage / main-menu truck."
msgstr ""
"VR: DLAA saņem tikai katras acs vidus (20 - 100 %); mala paliek spēles attēls. Samaziniet, lai "
"atļautos smagāku modeli vai vairāk FPS; 40 % maksā apmēram 40 % no modeļa. Iestata arī garāžas / "
"galvenās izvēlnes kravas auto."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How moving parts and truck mirrors are handled by DLAA. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it "
"starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Kā DLAA apstrādā kustīgas daļas un kravas auto spoguļus. Pa labi atver grupu, pa kreisi aizver; "
"atverot izvēlni, tā vienmēr ir aizvērta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLAA follows each moving thing on its own (traffic, wheels, number plates), so it stays sharp and "
"leaves no trail. Turn it off only to save about 0.5 ms per eye or to test: everything then moves "
"with the camera and traffic smears."
msgstr ""
"DLAA seko katram kustīgam objektam atsevišķi (satiksme, riteņi, numurzīmes), tāpēc attēls paliek "
"ass un bez pēdām. Izslēdziet tikai, lai ietaupītu apmēram 0,5 ms uz aci vai testam: tad viss "
"kustas līdz ar kameru un satiksme izsmērējas."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Smooths the truck mirrors too, so they do not shimmer. 1 mirror = only the largest (the main "
"mirror next to you). all = every mirror. camera = cheapest per mirror, moving traffic can leave "
"trails in the glass; the others follow each moving thing."
msgstr ""
"Izlīdzina arī kravas auto spoguļus, lai tie nemirgotu. 1 spogulis = tikai lielākais (galvenais "
"blakus jums). visi = katrs spogulis. kamera = lētākais uz spoguli, kustīga satiksme var atstāt "
"pēdas stiklā; pārējie seko katram kustīgam objektam."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"on = each mirror gets its DLAA every 2nd frame and shows its last clean picture in between: about "
"half the mirror cost. Edges stay clean; moving things in the glass update at half rate. off = "
"every mirror every frame."
msgstr ""
"ieslēgts = katrs spogulis saņem DLAA ik pēc 2. kadra un starplaikā rāda pēdējo tīro attēlu: "
"apmēram puse no spoguļu cenas. Malas paliek tīras; kustīgais stiklā atjaunojas uz pusi retāk. "
"izslēgts = katrs spogulis katrā kadrā."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Frame rate and CPU: CPU tuning, AMD cache cores, an FPS cap and Low delay (Reflex) for flat, an "
"FPS cap for VR. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Kadru ātrums un CPU: CPU regulēšana, AMD kešatmiņas kodoli, FPS robeža un zema aizture (Reflex) "
"plakanajam režīmam, FPS robeža VR. Pa labi atver grupu, pa kreisi aizver; katru reizi, kad "
"izvēlne tiek atvērta, tā ir aizvērta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Three CPU switches together. Prefer fast cores: only Intel CPUs with P-cores and E-cores. Higher "
"priority and no Windows power saving for the game: every CPU, Intel and AMD. Helps when the CPU "
"is the limit; no cost. Separate in dlaa.ini: cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."
msgstr ""
"Trīs CPU slēdži kopā. Dod priekšroku ātrajiem kodoliem: tikai Intel procesoriem ar P- un "
"E-kodoliem. Augsta prioritāte un bez Windows enerģijas taupīšanas spēlei: jebkurš CPU, Intel un "
"AMD. Palīdz, kad ierobežo CPU; bez izmaksām. Atsevišķi dlaa.ini: cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, "
"cpu_no_throttle."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"AMD X3D CPUs with two core groups (7950X3D, 9950X3D): keeps the game on the cores with the big 3D "
"V-Cache, which games like. Switches at once; off gives the game all cores back. Try it and "
"compare in a busy city. No cost."
msgstr ""
"AMD X3D procesori ar divām kodolu grupām (7950X3D, 9950X3D): notur spēli uz kodoliem ar lielo 3D "
"V-Cache, ko spēles mīl. Pārslēdzas uzreiz; izslēgts atdod spēlei visus kodolus. Izmēģiniet un "
"salīdziniet noslogotā pilsētā. Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only. Holds the game at most at this frame rate: a steady frame time, less heat and power. "
"Set it a bit below what your PC holds in a busy city. With Low delay (Reflex) on, the NVIDIA "
"driver does the limiting. off = no limit."
msgstr ""
"Tikai plakanais režīms. Notur spēli ne augstāk par šo kadru ātrumu: vienmērīgs kadra laiks, mazāk "
"siltuma un enerģijas. Iestatiet nedaudz zem tā, ko jūsu dators notur noslogotā pilsētā. Ja zema "
"aizture (Reflex) ir ieslēgta, ierobežo NVIDIA draiveris. izslēgts = bez robežas."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only, NVIDIA only (NVIDIA Reflex). On = the game's frames wait less before the graphics card "
"draws them: less delay between your steering and the picture when the card is the limit. Boost "
"also keeps the card's clocks up. Same fps; small cost."
msgstr ""
"Tikai plakanais režīms, tikai NVIDIA (NVIDIA Reflex). Iesl. = spēles kadri gaida mazāk, pirms "
"videokarte tos uzzīmē: mazāka aizture starp stūri un attēlu, kad ierobežo videokarte. Boost notur "
"arī kartes takti augstu. Tie paši fps; neliela cena."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. half = the game draws every 2nd headset frame (72 Hz -> 36 fps), third = every 3rd; the "
"headset's frame smoothing (ASW / Motion Smoothing) fills in the rest at a steady rhythm. Use it "
"when the fps swings. Turns Turbo off while on."
msgstr ""
"Tikai VR. puse = spēle zīmē katru 2. austiņu kadru (72 Hz -> 36 fps), trešdaļa = katru 3.; "
"austiņu kadru izlīdzināšana (ASW / Motion Smoothing) aizpilda pārējo vienmērīgā ritmā. "
"Izmantojiet, kad fps lēkā. Kamēr ieslēgts, Turbo ir izslēgts."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR speed-ups: Turbo, foveated rendering, skipping the hidden lens edges, and whether OFXR Bridge "
"/ VectorXR are found. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu "
"opens."
msgstr ""
"VR paātrinājumi: Turbo, foveated renderēšana, slēpto lēcu malu izlaišana un vai OFXR Bridge / "
"VectorXR ir atrasti. Pa labi atver grupu, pa kreisi aizver; katru reizi, kad izvēlne tiek "
"atvērta, tā ir aizvērta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Turbo switches off the headset's frame smoothing (ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW). VR only. On = "
"the game stops waiting for the headset each frame: more fps only when the CPU is the limit (busy "
"cities, traffic). Turn it off if the picture judders."
msgstr ""
"Turbo izslēdz austiņu kadru izlīdzināšanu (ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW). Tikai VR. Iesl. = spēle "
"negaida austiņas katrā kadrā: vairāk fps tikai tad, kad ierobežo CPU (noslogotas pilsētas, "
"satiksme). Izslēdziet, ja attēls raustās."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharp centre, lower detail at the edge (NVIDIA RTX only). Saves GPU time at high Scaling. VR "
"only. The outer ring gets one colour per 2 x 2 pixels; fences, grass and leaves keep full detail. "
"Turn it off if the edge looks blocky."
msgstr ""
"Ass centrs, mazāk detaļu malā (tikai NVIDIA RTX). Ietaupa GPU laiku pie liela Scaling. Tikai VR. "
"Ārējais gredzens saņem vienu krāsu uz 2 x 2 pikseļiem; žogi, zāle un lapas saglabā pilnu "
"detalizāciju. Izslēdziet, ja mala izskatās kubiska."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How big the sharp centre of Foveated rendering is, 10 - 100 % in 5 % steps: bigger = more of the "
"view sharp, less saving; smaller = more saving, lower detail starts closer to the middle. 80 % "
"(balanced) is the default; 90 = wide, 65 = narrow."
msgstr ""
"Cik liels ir Foveated renderēšanas asais centrs, 10 - 100 % ar soli 5 %: lielāks = vairāk skata "
"ass, mazāk ietaupījuma; mazāks = vairāk ietaupījuma, zemā detalizācija sākas tuvāk vidum. Pēc "
"noklusējuma 80 % (līdzsvars); 90 = plašs, 65 = šaurs."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What Foveated rendering makes coarser. scene = the 3D world only (default). scene + lighting = "
"also the game's lighting, at the very edge only: more saving. Test it: look for blocky light or "
"shadow edges at the side of your view."
msgstr ""
"Ko Foveated renderēšana padara rupjāku. aina = tikai 3D pasaule (pēc noklusējuma). aina + "
"apgaismojums = arī spēles apgaismojums, tikai pašā malā: lielāks ietaupījums. Pārbaudiet: "
"meklējiet kubiskas gaismas vai ēnu malas skata sānos."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How coarse the outer ring of Foveated rendering is. Normal = 1 colour per 2 x 2 pixels (default). "
"Strong = per 4 x 2, Max = per 4 x 4: more GPU saving, blockier edges. Best with eye tracking, "
"where you never look at the outer ring."
msgstr ""
"Cik rupjš ir Foveated renderēšanas ārējais gredzens. Parasts = 1 krāsa uz 2 x 2 pikseļiem (pēc "
"noklusējuma). Spēcīgs = uz 4 x 2, Maks. = uz 4 x 4: lielāks GPU ietaupījums, kubiskākas malas. "
"Vislabāk ar acu izsekošanu, kur uz ārējo gredzenu nekad neskatāties."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental. The sharp centre of Foveated rendering follows your eyes on a headset with eye "
"tracking (for example Varjo); without it the centre stays in the middle of the lens. Needs "
"Foveated rendering on at the game's start, else a restart. Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Eksperimentāli. Foveated renderēšanas asais centrs seko jūsu acīm austiņās ar acu izsekošanu "
"(piemēram, Varjo); bez tās centrs paliek lēcas vidū. Foveated renderēšanai jābūt ieslēgtai spēles "
"startā, citādi vajag restartu. Gandrīz bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. The game skips the lens corners you never see (the headset reports them), so it draws "
"fewer pixels: more GPU headroom, the picture you see stays the same. The first switch-on needs a "
"game restart. Turn it off if the edge of the view looks wrong."
msgstr ""
"Tikai VR. Spēle izlaiž lēcu stūrus, ko neredzat (VR brilles tos paziņo), tāpēc zīmē mazāk "
"pikseļu: vairāk GPU rezerves, redzamais attēls tāds pats. Pirmajai ieslēgšanai vajag restartēt "
"spēli. Izslēdziet, ja skata mala izskatās nepareizi."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"OFXR Bridge = VR frame generation by djules75, a separate download "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). found = its layer is loaded in this game and the mod lets its "
"work pass through. Start its tray app before the game."
msgstr ""
"OFXR Bridge = VR kadru ģenerēšana (djules75), atsevišķa lejupielāde "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). atrasts = tā slānis ir ielādēts šajā spēlē un modifikācija "
"ļauj tā darbam iet cauri. Palaidiet tā tray lietotni pirms spēles."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VectorXR = an OpenXR enhancement suite by DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, "
"Depth, frame generation; found = its layer is loaded in the game and the mod lets its work pass "
"through. Run only one Turbo (its or the mod's)."
msgstr ""
"VectorXR = OpenXR uzlabojumu komplekts (DienerTech) (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, "
"Depth, kadru ģenerēšana; atrasts = tā slānis ir ielādēts spēlē un modifikācija ļauj tā darbam iet "
"cauri. Izmantojiet tikai vienu Turbo (tā vai modifikācijas)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Where the game's own VR UI floats (HUD, menus). The mod types the change into the game's console "
"for you; needs g_developer and g_console 1 in config.cfg. Right opens the group, Left closes it."
msgstr ""
"Kur peld pašas spēles VR UI (HUD, izvēlnes). Modifikācija ieraksta izmaiņu spēles konsolē jūsu "
"vietā; vajag g_developer un g_console 1 failā config.cfg. Pa labi atver grupu, pa kreisi aizver."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Which of the game's VR UI layouts the rows below move: driving (the HUD while driving) or menus "
"(the game's menu screens)."
msgstr ""
"Kuru spēles VR UI izkārtojumu pārbīda zemāk esošās rindas: braukšana (HUD braucot) vai izvēlnes "
"(spēles izvēlņu ekrāni)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the game's VR UI: height, side, distance, tilt, turn, size or curve, in small steps. The "
"game gets each change about 0.4 s after your last press: the console opens and closes by itself."
msgstr ""
"Pārbīda spēles VR UI: augstumu, pusi, attālumu, slīpumu, pagriezienu, izmēru vai izliekumu, "
"nelieliem soļiem. Spēle saņem katru izmaiņu apmēram 0,4 s pēc pēdējā nospiediena: konsole pati "
"atveras un aizveras."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Right: every value of both layouts back to what config.cfg had at the start (the game saves its "
"own values when it exits)."
msgstr ""
"Pa labi: visas abu izkārtojumu vērtības atgriežas pie tā, kas config.cfg bija sākumā (spēle savas "
"vērtības saglabā, izejot)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"A small live fps and frame-time box, also while this menu is closed (flat and VR): fps, ms, "
"numbers only, each with or without a graph of recent frame times (spikes show red), or the graph "
"alone. Its GPU cost is measured. Save keeps it."
msgstr ""
"Neliela dzīva fps un kadra laika kaste, arī kad šī izvēlne ir aizvērta (plakanais režīms un VR): "
"fps, ms, tikai skaitļi, katrs ar nesen kadru laiku grafiku (lēcieni ir sarkani) vai bez tā, vai "
"tikai grafiks. Tās GPU cena ir izmērīta. Saglabāt to paturēs."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The fps box's lock, position, size, colour, VR distance and turn. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"FPS lodziņa fiksācija, pozīcija, izmērs, krāsa, VR attālums un pagrieziens. Pa labi atver grupu, "
"pa kreisi aizver; atverot izvēlni, tā vienmēr ir aizvērta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees around you). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Pārvieto fps lodziņu uz sāniem, % no ekrāna (VR fiksēts / pie: grādi ap jums). Plakanajam un VR "
"ir sava pozīcija. Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees, minus = up). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Pārvieto fps lodziņu uz augšu / leju, % no ekrāna (VR fiksēts / pie: grādi, mīnuss = uz augšu). "
"Plakanajam un VR ir sava pozīcija. Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes the fps box bigger or smaller (0.2 .. 3.0). Raise it if you cannot read it in the headset "
"or on a big screen. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Padara fps lodziņu lielāku vai mazāku (0.2 .. 3.0). Palieliniet, ja nevarat izlasīt VR brillēs "
"vai lielā ekrānā. Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The colour of the fps box's text: 20 colours, each with an outline so it reads on any picture "
"(black on white = dark text, white outline). Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"FPS lodziņa teksta krāsa: 20 krāsas, katrai ar apmali, lai būtu salasāma uz jebkura attēla (melna "
"uz baltas = tumšs teksts, balta apmale). Plakanais un VR. Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How bright the fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = the colour as it is, lower dims the text (the "
"outline stays) toward black. Use it to tone the counter down at night or in the headset. Flat and "
"VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"FPS lodziņa spilgtums, 10 - 100 %: 100 = krāsa kā ir, zemāks aptumšo tekstu (apmale paliek) uz "
"melnu. Izmantojiet skaitītāja pieklusināšanai naktī vai VR brillēs. Plakanais un VR. Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How see-through the whole fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = solid, lower fades the text AND its black "
"outline together, so a dimmed box does not turn into a black blob. Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Cik caurspīdīgs ir viss fps lodziņš, 10 - 100 %: 100 = necaurspīdīgs, zemāks izbalina tekstu UN "
"tā melno apmali kopā, lai aptumšots lodziņš nekļūtu par melnu plankumu. Plakanais un VR. Bez "
"izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How far back the fps graph shows: 2 - 60 s. One bar per slice of time = its slowest frame, so you "
"see spikes. Green = on time, yellow = a bit slow, red = a hitch; the line = the headset rate / "
"FPS cap / your usual. Shown when FPS counter has a graph."
msgstr ""
"Cik tālu atpakaļ rāda fps grafiks: 2 - 60 s. Viena kolonna uz laika posmu = tā lēnākais kadrs, "
"tāpēc redzami lēcieni. Zaļš = laikā, dzeltens = mazliet lēni, sarkans = aizķeršanās; līnija = "
"austiņu frekvence / FPS robeža / jūsu ierastais. Redzams, kad FPS skaitītājam ir grafiks."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = moves with the headset. Fixed in play space = one spot around your seat, "
"ignores the cab's sway. Attached to vehicle = stuck to the cab, sways with it (needs DLAA + Track "
"moving parts). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Tikai VR. Seko galvai = kustas līdz ar austiņām. Fiksēts telpā = viena vieta ap jūsu sēdekli, "
"nelīgojas līdz ar kabīni. Pie transportlīdz. = pielipināts pie kabīnes, līgojas līdz ar to (vajag "
"DLAA + kustīgo daļu izsekošanu). Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. On = each truck / car keeps its own fps box spot in the cab, turn, "
"size, colour, brightness and text (saved in dlaa.ini when the menu closes). Off = one shared set "
"for every vehicle. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Tikai VR, Pie transportlīdz. Ieslēgts = katrs kravas auto / auto saglabā savu fps lodziņa vietu "
"kabīnē, pagriezienu, izmēru, krāsu, spilgtumu un tekstu (saglabājas dlaa.ini, aizverot izvēlni). "
"Izslēgts = viens kopīgs komplekts visiem transportlīdzekļiem. Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. Right = measure the cab again now (sit still, parked) if the box "
"sits off. Left = this vehicle's box back to the defaults (spot, turn, size, colour, text); other "
"vehicles keep theirs. The box is square to the cab."
msgstr ""
"Tikai VR, Pie transportlīdz. Pa labi = izmērīt kabīni vēlreiz (sēdiet mierīgi, stāvot), ja "
"lodziņš nav savā vietā. Pa kreisi = šī transportlīdzekļa lodziņš uz noklusējumiem (vieta, "
"pagrieziens, izmērs, krāsa, teksts); citi saglabā savus. Lodziņš ir taisns pret kabīni."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Turns the fps box left / right on itself, in degrees (+ = its face "
"turns to the right). Use it to angle the box when it sits at the side. 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Tikai VR, tāpēc plakanajā pelēks. Pagriež fps lodziņu pa kreisi / pa labi, grādos (+ = seja "
"pagriežas pa labi). Izmantojiet lodziņa sasvēršanai, kad tas ir sānos. 0 = vērsts pret jums. Bez "
"izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Tilts the fps box, in degrees (+ = its top leans away from you, as if "
"lying on the dashboard). 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Tikai VR, tāpēc plakanajā pelēks. Noliec fps lodziņu, grādos (+ = augšdaļa noliecas prom no jums, "
"it kā gulētu uz paneļa). 0 = vērsts pret jums. Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Rotates the fps box in its own plane, in degrees (+ = clockwise). 0 = "
"upright. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Tikai VR, tāpēc plakanajā pelēks. Pagriež fps lodziņu savā plaknē, grādos (+ = pulksteņrādītāja "
"virzienā). 0 = taisni. Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the fps box floats, 0.30 - 3.00 m. It keeps the same "
"size in your view at every distance; only the depth changes. Put it near the depth you look at to "
"read it without refocusing. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Tikai VR, tāpēc plakanajā pelēks. Cik tālu fps lodziņš peld, 0.30 - 3.00 m. Tas saglabā to pašu "
"izmēru jūsu skatā jebkurā attālumā; mainās tikai dziļums. Novietojiet tuvu dziļumam, uz kuru "
"skatāties, lai lasītu bez pārfokusēšanas. Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The panel's position, size, depth, facing and the menu keys. Right opens the group, Left closes "
"it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Paneļa pozīcija, izmērs, dziļums, virziens un izvēlnes taustiņi. Pa labi atver grupu, pa kreisi "
"aizver; atverot izvēlni, tā vienmēr ir aizvērta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees around your seat). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Pārvieto paneli uz sāniem, % no ekrāna (VR fiksēts kabīnē: grādi ap sēdekli). Plakanajam un VR ir "
"sava pozīcija. Izmantojiet, ja panelis aizsedz vajadzīgo. Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees, plus = down). Flat and "
"VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Pārvieto paneli uz augšu / leju, % no ekrāna (VR fiksēts kabīnē: grādi, plus = uz leju). "
"Plakanajam un VR ir sava pozīcija. Izmantojiet, ja panelis aizsedz vajadzīgo. Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes this panel bigger or smaller. Raise it if you cannot read it, lower it if it covers too "
"much. Flat and VR each keep their own size. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Padara paneli lielāku vai mazāku. Palieliniet, ja nevarat izlasīt, samaziniet, ja aizsedz par "
"daudz. Plakanajam un VR ir savs izmērs. Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = the panel moves with the headset. Fixed in cab = it stays at one spot in "
"front of your seat, steady while you look around; X / Y / depth then set that spot (degrees, "
"metres). Needs the VR layer (default). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Tikai VR. Seko galvai = panelis kustas līdzi VR brillēm. Fiksēts kabīnē = paliek vienā vietā jūsu "
"sēdekļa priekšā, stabils, skatoties apkārt; X / Y / dziļums iestata šo vietu (grādi, metri). "
"Vajag VR slāni (noklusējums). Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the panel floats: in metres (0.30 - 3.00) as a VR layer, "
"the default; in px of inward shift per eye with menu_vr_layer = 0. Same size at every depth. "
"Change it if the panel is tiring to look at. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Tikai VR, tāpēc plakanajā pelēks. Cik tālu panelis peld: metros (0.30 - 3.00) kā VR slānis, "
"noklusējums; pikseļos uz iekšu uz aci, ja menu_vr_layer = 0. Tāds pats izmērs jebkurā dziļumā. "
"Mainiet, ja panelī skatīties nogurdina. Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. On = the panel turns to face you when you move it to the side, same "
"size from every angle (as a VR layer, the default, the head-following fps box too); off = a flat "
"picture. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Tikai VR, tāpēc plakanajā pelēks. Ieslēgts = panelis pagriežas pret jums, kad to pārvietojat uz "
"sāniem, tāds pats izmērs no jebkura leņķa (kā VR slānis, noklusējums, arī galvai sekojošais fps "
"lodziņš); izslēgts = plakans attēls. Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Switches for comparing: DLAA off, the game's own TAA mixed in or side by side, the wire fixes, "
"running DLAA earlier. Nothing here is needed for normal driving. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it."
msgstr ""
"Slēdži salīdzināšanai: DLAA izslēgts, spēles paša TAA sajaukts vai blakus, vadu labojumi, DLAA "
"palaišana agrāk. Parastai braukšanai nekas no tā nav vajadzīgs. Pa labi atver grupu, pa kreisi "
"aizver."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Switches the whole mod on or off and keeps the mode; off shows the game's own picture, for "
"comparing. Off saves the cost of every part together."
msgstr ""
"Ieslēdz vai izslēdz visu modifikāciju un atceras režīmu; off rāda pašas spēles attēlu "
"salīdzināšanai. Izslēgts ietaupa visu daļu cenu kopā."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"on = the mod on the left, the game's own TAA on the right, to compare (Split line position, "
"Split: left | right). Replaces Mix while on. With the game's console on, the mod switches the "
"game's Anti-aliasing for you."
msgstr ""
"iesl. = modifikācija pa kreisi, pašas spēles TAA pa labi, salīdzināšanai (Dalījuma līnijas vieta, "
"Dalījums: kreisā | labā). Kamēr ieslēgts, aizstāj Maisījumu. Ja spēles konsole ir ieslēgta, "
"modifikācija jūsu vietā pārslēdz spēles Anti-aliasing."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Where the split line is, 0 - 100 % of the width in 5 % steps: the mod's DLAA / DLSS on the left "
"of it, the game's TAA on the right. Used only while Split with game TAA is on."
msgstr ""
"Kur atrodas dalījuma līnija, 0 - 100 % no platuma ar soli 5 %: pa kreisi no tās modifikācijas "
"DLAA / DLSS, pa labi spēles TAA. Tiek izmantots tikai tad, kad Dalījums ar spēles TAA ir ieslēgts."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What the split shows on its two sides: DLAA | TAA (the mod left, the game's TAA right), Mix | TAA "
"or DLAA | Mix (Mix = the two blended at Mix amount). DLSS instead of DLAA when upscaling. Used "
"only while Split with game TAA is on."
msgstr ""
"Ko dalījums rāda abās pusēs: DLAA | TAA (modifikācija pa kreisi, spēles TAA pa labi), maisījums | "
"TAA vai DLAA | maisījums (maisījums = abi sajaukti pēc Maisījuma daudzuma). Palielinot attēlu, "
"DLSS DLAA vietā. Tiek izmantots tikai tad, kad Dalījums ar spēles TAA ir ieslēgts."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires move correctly while you drive: their movement is spread over the whole thin line. on "
"= default. off = only to compare; near wires flicker more. The picture is soft for a moment when "
"you switch."
msgstr ""
"Plānie vadi braukšanas laikā kustas pareizi: to kustība tiek izkliedēta pa visu plāno līniju. "
"iesl. = pēc noklusējuma. izslēgts = tikai salīdzināšanai; tuvi vadi mirgo vairāk. Pārslēdzot "
"attēls uz mirkli kļūst mīksts."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires count as in front on every pixel they touch, even where they cover only a sliver of "
"it. on = default. on (no A2C) = also for see-through edges such as leaves. off = only to compare; "
"near wires flicker more."
msgstr ""
"Plānie vadi tiek skaitīti kā priekšplānā uz katra pikseļa, ko tie skar, pat ja tie aizsedz tikai "
"mazu tā daļu. iesl. = pēc noklusējuma. iesl. (bez A2C) = arī caurspīdīgām malām, piemēram, lapām. "
"izslēgts = tikai salīdzināšanai; tuvi vadi mirgo vairāk."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental: draws far wires that are thinner than 1 pixel as a 1 pixel line, so they do not "
"break into dashes. Off by default: far wires may look darker or flicker more. Try it and compare."
msgstr ""
"Eksperimentāls: tālus vadus, plānākus par 1 pikseli, zīmē kā 1 pikseļa līniju, lai tie nesaplīstu "
"svītrās. Pēc noklusējuma izslēgts: tāli vadi var izskatīties tumšāki vai vairāk mirgot. "
"Izmēģiniet un salīdziniet."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only: DLAA runs before the game adds its glow and colour look, so lane paint, wires and "
"rails shimmer less. Change it only to compare. Not used with DLSS upscaling or Windows HDR. Same "
"cost either way; takes about a second to switch."
msgstr ""
"Tikai plakanais režīms: DLAA darbojas, pirms spēle pievieno mirdzumu un krāsu izskatu, tāpēc ceļa "
"marķējums, vadi un sliedes mirgo mazāk. Mainiet tikai salīdzināšanai. Netiek izmantots ar DLSS "
"palielināšanu un Windows HDR. Tāda pati cena; pārslēgšana aizņem apmēram sekundi."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Bug report: press the capture key twice (or Capture now) where something looks wrong; the mod "
"writes one zip you attach to a GitHub issue. Right opens the group, Left closes it."
msgstr ""
"Kļūdas ziņojums: divreiz nospiediet tveršanas taustiņu (vai Tvert tagad) tur, kur kaut kas "
"izskatās nepareizi; modifikācija ieraksta vienu zip, ko pievienojat GitHub issue. Pa labi atver "
"grupu, pa kreisi aizver."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"One switch for the most complete report: log detail debug, rewind 2 s, capture Full. Off puts the "
"rows back as they were. Only this switch is saved; the forced values are never written to "
"dlaa.ini."
msgstr ""
"Viens slēdzis pilnīgākajam ziņojumam: žurnāla detalizācija debug, attīšana 2 s, tveršana Pilna. "
"Izslēgts atgriež rindas, kā bija. Tiek saglabāts tikai šis slēdzis; piespiestās vērtības nekad "
"netiek rakstītas dlaa.ini."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What goes into dlaa_inject.log: off = nothing; errors = failures only (default); warnings = + "
"problems worked around; info = + start-up and changes; debug = + statistics and timing "
"measurements (a little slower)."
msgstr ""
"Kas nonāk dlaa_inject.log: izslēgts = nekas; kļūdas = tikai kļūmes (pēc noklusējuma); brīdinājumi "
"= + apietās problēmas; info = + starts un izmaiņas; atkļūdošana = + statistika un laika mērījumi "
"(mazliet lēnāk)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Keeps the last 0.5 - 3 s of frames on the graphics card all the time, so the report shows the "
"moment BEFORE the key (+ what DLSS got for the last frames). Costs graphics memory (the MB in the "
"cost column) and a picture copy per frame. off = none."
msgstr ""
"Visu laiku notur videokartē pēdējās 0,5 - 3 s kadru, lai ziņojums rādītu brīdi PIRMS taustiņa (+ "
"ko DLSS saņēma pēdējos kadros). Maksā video atmiņu (MB izmaksu kolonnā) un attēla kopiju katrā "
"kadrā. izslēgts = nav."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Quick = system info, logs, settings, your picture and DLAA off for a few frames (about 1 s). Full "
"= + what DLSS got per frame (colour, motion, depth) and A/B sets: motion view, motion off, jitter "
"only (about 2 - 4 s)."
msgstr ""
"Ātri = sistēmas info, žurnāli, iestatījumi, jūsu attēls un DLAA izslēgts dažus kadrus (apmēram 1 "
"s). Pilni = + ko DLSS saņēma katrā kadrā (krāsa, kustība, dziļums) un A/B komplekti: kustības "
"skats, kustība izslēgta, tikai džiters (apmēram 2 - 4 s)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The capture key. Press it TWICE within 1 s while driving where it goes wrong (the first press "
"only arms it: one short beep). Right opens the Hotkeys page on its line to change it."
msgstr ""
"Tveršanas taustiņš. Nospiediet to DIVREIZ 1 s laikā braukšanas laikā tur, kur kaut kas noiet "
"greizi (pirmais nospiedums to tikai sagatavo: viena īsa skaņa). Pa labi atver karsto taustiņu "
"lapu uz tā rindas, lai to mainītu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How many captures stay in the dlaa_selftest folder next to the DLL: older ones (folder + zip) are "
"deleted when a new one is written. all = never delete."
msgstr ""
"Cik tveršanu paliek mapē dlaa_selftest blakus DLL: vecākās (mape + zip) tiek dzēstas, kad raksta "
"jaunu. visas = nekad nedzēš."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The language of this menu. auto = the game's language (default); Left / Right picks another one. "
"Linux / Proton: Chinese, Japanese and Korean need their fonts installed, see the README. A "
"lang\\<code>.po file next to the DLL wins, for your own fixes. Save keeps it. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Šīs izvēlnes valoda. auto = spēles valoda (noklusējums); pa kreisi / pa labi izvēlas citu. Linux "
"/ Proton: ķīniešu, japāņu un korejiešu valodai vajag fontus, skatiet README. Blakus DLL esošs "
"lang\\<code>.po uzvar, jūsu pašu labojumiem. Saglabāt dlaa.ini to saglabā. Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Every hotkey of this menu, one line per action, with its keyboard key and controller button. "
"Right opens the list; pick an action with Right, then press the new key or wheel button. Saved to "
"dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"Visi šīs izvēlnes karstie taustiņi, viena rinda uz darbību, ar tastatūras taustiņu un kontroliera "
"pogu. Pa labi atver sarakstu; ar labo izvēlieties darbību, tad nospiediet jaunu taustiņu vai "
"stūres pogu. Uzreiz saglabājas dlaa.ini."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Writes everything shown here into dlaa.ini (settings, and the panel / fps box positions once you "
"moved them), keeping every other line. Do it once you like what you see, or the changes are gone "
"at the next start. Mode saves itself."
msgstr ""
"Ieraksta visu šeit redzamo dlaa.ini (iestatījumus un paneļa / fps lodziņa pozīcijas, kad esat tos "
"pārvietojuši), saglabājot visas pārējās rindas. Dariet to, kad patīk redzamais, citādi izmaiņas "
"pazudīs nākamajā palaišanā. Režīms saglabājas pats."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Puts every setting in this menu back to how the mod ships (model, sharpen, texture sharpness, "
"DLAA area, motion, mirrors, preset, panel, fps box, turbo, foveated, frame rate, CPU, log "
"detail), live and in dlaa.ini, keeping your hotkeys and every other line."
msgstr ""
"Atgriež katru šīs izvēlnes iestatījumu tādu, kādu modifikācija tiek piegādāta (modelis, "
"asināšana, tekstūru asums, DLAA zona, kustība, spoguļi, sagatave, panelis, fps kaste, turbo, "
"foveated, kadru ātrums, CPU, žurnāla detalizācija), uzreiz un dlaa.ini, saglabājot jūsu karstos "
"taustiņus un visas citas rindas."

