#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Back to the main menu. %hs does the same on every line of this page. Every key and controller "
"button except the 5 menu keys still reaches the game while this menu is open, so you can keep "
"driving."
msgstr ""
"Atpakaļ uz galveno izvēlni. %hs dara to pašu katrā šīs lapas rindā. Katrs taustiņš un kontroliera "
"poga, izņemot 5 izvēlnes taustiņus, joprojām sasniedz spēli, kamēr izvēlne atvērta, tāpēc varat "
"turpināt braukt."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Press ONE new key or controller button for %ls: any key, also another menu key (it is taken from "
"it). Keys / buttons already held now are ignored until released. Esc or Backspace cancels, so "
"does 10 s without a press; menu keys cannot be cleared here."
msgstr ""
"Nospiediet VIENU jaunu taustiņu vai kontroliera pogu darbībai %ls: jebkuru taustiņu, arī citu "
"izvēlnes taustiņu (tas tiek paņemts no tā). Tagad turētie taustiņi / pogas tiek ignorēti, līdz "
"tos atlaiž. Esc vai Backspace atceļ, tāpat 10 s bez nospiešanas; izvēlnes taustiņus šeit dzēst "
"nevar."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Press ONE new key (Shift / Ctrl / Alt with it make a combination) or controller button / D-pad "
"direction. Keys / buttons already held now (a shifter gear) are ignored until released; axes "
"never bind. %hs or Esc cancels, Backspace clears to none, 10 s without a press cancels."
msgstr ""
"Nospiediet VIENU jaunu taustiņu (Shift / Ctrl / Alt kopā ar to veido kombināciju) vai kontroliera "
"pogu / D-pad virzienu. Tagad turētie taustiņi / pogas (pārnesumkārbas pārnesums) tiek ignorēti, "
"līdz tos atlaiž; asis nekad neiesaista. %hs vai Esc atceļ, Backspace dzēš uz nav, 10 s bez "
"nospiešanas atceļ."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"One of the 5 keys that drive this menu (dlaa.ini %hs). %hs, then press the new key or button: the "
"other menu keys can be taken too. These lines cannot be cleared, and each of the 5 must keep a "
"binding (a press that leaves another one empty is refused). Saved to dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"Viens no 5 taustiņiem, kas vada šo izvēlni (dlaa.ini %hs). %hs, tad nospiediet jaunu taustiņu vai "
"pogu: var paņemt arī citus izvēlnes taustiņus. Šīs rindas nevar dzēst, un katram no 5 jābūt "
"piesaistei (nospiešana, kas atstātu citu tukšu, tiek noraidīta). Uzreiz saglabājas dlaa.ini."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%ls (dlaa.ini %hs). %hs, then press the new key or button: a key replaces the Keyboard part, a "
"controller button or D-pad direction the Controller part. A key / button used by another action "
"moves here. Saved to dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"%ls (dlaa.ini %hs). %hs, tad nospiediet jaunu taustiņu vai pogu: taustiņš aizstāj Tastatūras "
"daļu, kontroliera poga vai D-pad virziens Kontroliera daļu. Citas darbības izmantots taustiņš / "
"poga pārvietojas šurp. Uzreiz saglabājas dlaa.ini."

