#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%hs = capture now (the menu closes first). The zip (dlaa_selftest folder next to the DLL) holds "
"system info, the mod's and the game's log, dlaa.ini, your picture and DLAA off; Full adds what "
"DLSS got and the A/B sets; rewind adds the moment before. Your user name and home folder are "
"removed. %ls"
msgstr ""
"%hs = tvert tagad (izvēlne vispirms aizveras). Zip (mape dlaa_selftest blakus DLL) satur sistēmas "
"info, modifikācijas un spēles žurnālu, dlaa.ini, jūsu attēlu un DLAA izslēgtu; Pilni pievieno to, "
"ko DLSS saņēma, un A/B komplektus; attīšana pievieno brīdi pirms tam. Jūsu lietotājvārds un mājas "
"mape tiek noņemti. %ls"

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The 5 keys that open and drive this menu: %hs opens / closes it (the value), %hs / %hs / %hs / "
"%hs move (Hotkey column). While the menu is open only these 5 are kept from the game. %hs: change "
"them on the Hotkeys page."
msgstr ""
"5 taustiņi, kas atver un vada šo izvēlni: %hs atver / aizver to (vērtība), %hs / %hs / %hs / %hs "
"pārvietojas (Karstā taustiņa kolonna). Kamēr izvēlne atvērta, spēlei netiek dots tikai šie 5. "
"%hs: mainiet tos Karsto taustiņu lapā."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Closes the menu; the 5 menu keys go back to the game. %hs does the same from any row."
msgstr "Aizver izvēlni; 5 izvēlnes taustiņi atgriežas spēlei. %hs dara to pašu no jebkuras rindas."

